          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/bridging-the-dimensionality-gap-a-taxonomy-and-survey-of-2d-vision-model-adaptation-for-3d-analysis-2/ >
            
              Bridging the Dimensionality Gap: A Taxonomy and Survey of 2D Vision Model Adaptation for 3D Analysis
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        Akshat Pandya
                      
                    </div>
                
              
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__spacer"></div>
