          <span data-tooltip-type="rich">
              <span class="glue-tooltip__body">This piece analyzes how hardware product managers can navigate the financial pressure of AI-related costs and trade tariffs. It presents a practical framework for deploying the Joint Development Model (JDM) as a product development strategy to balance innovation with cost efficiency, enabling sustainable growth for next-generation AI-native consumer devices.</span>
              















